```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner credential --help
Manage runner credential lifecycle

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner credential [COMMAND]

Commands:
  list    List non-secret runner credential metadata
  retire  Schedule fixed-grace credential retirement
  revoke  Revoke a runner credential immediately
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
